{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "b068af4f10c8df50a1703a3164e398c07f9e6b8deb88263c3493c35f1fad6829", "ja": "一日署長体験のお仕事", "zh": "一日署长体验的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3000_place", "source_sha256": "6a60a4bfd65665c438a8830864ef5c023f36f6a7e898aae89585d37770f72eab", "ja": "消防署", "zh": "消防署", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3001_p", "source_sha256": "93f75ac04ccd5447dbcf7514427f9e415dec86fc51c976e8f60c4d93a50bc4b7", "ja": "今日一日、消防署長を務めることになったわけだが\n……麗花。災害時の基本、覚えてきたか？", "zh": "今天一天，你要担任消防署长……\n丽花，你记好灾害发生时的基本步骤了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3002_048rei", "source_sha256": "5efb5cd8b9b47c4605dd847aa1c8a5d167a08c86e8c2e3152565d116563bb262", "ja": "『お・は・し』ですよね。バッチリです♪\nでも……。", "zh": "是『不语、不跑、不推』吧？记得清清楚楚♪\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3003_048rei", "source_sha256": "2ddace042696a1f8299eb81d2299bcfdee0ba9aef549eda38467fa65034f1cca", "ja": "私、オリジナルの呼びかけを考えてきたんです！\nそれを発表できたらいいなーって……。ダメですか？", "zh": "我想了一个自创的口诀！\n想说要是可以发表就好了……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3004", "source_sha256": "dad8147a54ce1f0e2b4049ee5abccb9fae62ac27915e06d49e989ab8225efd77", "ja": "『お・は・し』で", "zh": "用『不语、不跑、不推』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3005", "source_sha256": "5d89ca4cfbd75fc6a86129c5a0220fe0e0c03c6c6c0e7cb68c88b13ded2001e6", "ja": "麗花に任せる", "zh": "交给丽花判断", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3100_p", "source_sha256": "ca11b0678a445ac2d49d23d0e5da2515314c7dda3b931e625a5069b030cd11cb", "ja": "真面目な場だから、アドリブは難しいかもな……。\n予定どおり、『お・は・し』で頼む。", "zh": "因为是正经的场合，可能不太适合即兴演出……\n就如同原先计划，用『不语、不跑、不推』吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3101_048rei", "source_sha256": "a01cc39fba556ac25e335c30fff439e6a4d8ea695944514a4c818f9ba21c484a", "ja": "わかりました！　真面目に、ですね。\nキッチリバッチリ、普通のお仕事、してきますね♪", "zh": "我知道了！要正经对吧。\n我会中规中矩地认真完成工作的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3200_p", "source_sha256": "ca11b0678a445ac2d49d23d0e5da2515314c7dda3b931e625a5069b030cd11cb", "ja": "真面目な場だから、アドリブは難しいかもな……。\n予定どおり、『お・は・し』で頼む。", "zh": "因为是正经的场合，可能不太适合即兴演出……\n就如同原先计划，用『不语、不跑、不推』吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3201_048rei", "source_sha256": "719a0a9a6edfd1083d2917499545ea5259c8b6682b65ccd4b1dc7727cb02e531", "ja": "はーい。ちょっぴり残念ですけど、\nちゃんとお仕事してきます♪", "zh": "好～虽然有点可惜，\n但我会好好工作的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3300_p", "source_sha256": "740f4ac9b51b1be76f48bb26a67dab4f5c4265c2fb5b6dedb619a39ba935cb38", "ja": "よし……わかった。\n麗花らしい呼びかけ、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好……我知道了，\n麻烦就用丽花风格的口诀吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3301_048rei", "source_sha256": "21ba5a6bb83ac99540afceffb2b73c8c19dea59fecc41f1198e1487f228ecb9c", "ja": "はい！\nどどーんと任せちゃってください♪", "zh": "好的！\n尽管交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3302_048rei", "source_sha256": "9badcac8ceb48dceefe1bc61c0bb946bd34286e985db9b73d07af8cb41b567a3", "ja": "……今日はみなさんに、新しい\n標語を覚えてもらいます。それはー……。", "zh": "……今天要请大家记住一个\n新的标语，那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3303_048rei", "source_sha256": "995158c076f9980c994ac62b332d6db2e9c2008e33a9bb69b34394a6fa68cdc8", "ja": "『れいせいに』『いどうしよう』\n『可及的速やかに』……略して『れ・い・か』！", "zh": "『冷静地』、『移动』、\n『花最少时间』……简称『丽、花』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3304_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f7b744c0899182b0f0b6e3cb06304d57a2607cbef331d1ae7fa6e5b8e4fd26e", "ja": "みなさーん、お墓まで持っていく勢いで、\nバッチリ覚えて帰ってくださいね♪", "zh": "各位～要抱着带进棺材的决心，\n牢牢记起来再回去喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3305_p", "source_sha256": "17646bb669a2ea254b1ae8967bd410660587ed2ce31c646b7fad23adc6546123", "ja": "（一瞬どよめいたものの、個性があって\n覚えやすいと大好評だ。よくやった、麗花！）", "zh": "（虽然一度引起现场骚然，但这个口诀\n独特又好记，大受好评。做得好，丽花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3400_p", "source_sha256": "740f4ac9b51b1be76f48bb26a67dab4f5c4265c2fb5b6dedb619a39ba935cb38", "ja": "よし……わかった。\n麗花らしい呼びかけ、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好……我知道了，\n麻烦就用丽花风格的口诀吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3401_048rei", "source_sha256": "21ba5a6bb83ac99540afceffb2b73c8c19dea59fecc41f1198e1487f228ecb9c", "ja": "はい！\nどどーんと任せちゃってください♪", "zh": "好的！\n尽管交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3402_048rei", "source_sha256": "9badcac8ceb48dceefe1bc61c0bb946bd34286e985db9b73d07af8cb41b567a3", "ja": "……今日はみなさんに、新しい\n標語を覚えてもらいます。それはー……。", "zh": "……今天要请大家记住一个\n新的标语，那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3403_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ada62973d41805a2357230d0e448068d4ceeb81ddf74446e8a2a8916ee8819e", "ja": "……あれれ？　さっきまで覚えてたのに、\n忘れちゃいました！　えへへ。", "zh": "……奇怪？刚刚明明还记得的，\n又突然忘记了！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_3404_p", "source_sha256": "6c07faba809a1b0fac707ef9fd45688758d3aa653c275d43edb71a6d50637962", "ja": "（麗花ー！！\nな、なんとか最後まで頑張ってくれ……！）", "zh": "（丽花──！！\n你、你要努力到最后啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
